WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:02.399
Soon you'll be able to earn virtual currency
in virtual reality.

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:05.950
If you take the number of hours that you spend
looking at a screen, a good chunk of that,

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.810
maybe all of that, gets replaced with a VR
helmet.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:11.100
Which means that, for a good chunk of people
in the world, the majority of their waking hours

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:11.920
are going to be spent in the Matrix.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:19.760
The Silicon Valley entrepreneur Balaji Srinivasan
is a modern-day polymath who venture capitalist

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.550
Marc Andreessen has called the person with
“the highest output per minute of new ideas

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.620
of anybody I’ve ever met in my life.”

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.980
A Ph.D. in electrical engineering, a co-founder
of a genetic testing firm,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.620
and a Stanford computer science lecturer, Srinivasan was 
also on Donald Trump’s

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.960
short list to head up the Food and Drug Administration.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:43.079
Today, he spends most of his time as CEO of
the cryptocurrency startup, Earn.com.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.300
Srinivasan believes in the power of technology
to provide a way for individuals

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.479
to migrate away from ossified institutions or destructive
policies.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.200
Borrowing from the classic book by Albert O. Hirschman,

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.460
he refers to this path as "exit."

